The Fusion method generates higher-quality videos more than 2.5 times faster than Vanilla and achieves the best performance even after extended training.
While using a single feature alignment significantly improves quality, the Fusion method further amplifies this effect, maximizing the benefits of alignment.
Here, SAM2 refers to the SAM2.1 Hiera image encoder.
</figcaption>
