</div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 6: </span> PCA visualization and tracking comparison videos of image and video encoders. <span class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Click each image to play the video in Acrobat Reader.</span>
</figcaption>
